1
00:00:00,799 --> 00:00:06,179
We'll arrange for her to move in across the
hall so he can pathetically moon over her.

2
00:00:08,056 --> 00:00:10,436
- Okay, that was uncalled for.
- You started it, dude.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,810
[GLASS CLINKING]

4
00:00:11,977 --> 00:00:14,147
(Gablehouser:)Could I have everyone's attention,
please?

5
00:00:14,896 --> 00:00:18,186
(Gablehouser:)What a wonderful occasion this is.

6
00:00:18,358 --> 00:00:21,738
(Gablehouser:)And how fortunate that it should
fall on Take Your Daughter to Work Day.

7
00:00:23,155 --> 00:00:27,245
(Gablehouser:)We're here to welcome Mr. Dennis Kim
to our little family.

8
00:00:27,409 --> 00:00:29,659
(Sheldon(sarcastically):)Welcome, Dennis Kim.

9
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:34,460
(Gablehouser:)Mr. Kim was not only the valedictorian
at Stanford University...

10
00:00:34,624 --> 00:00:39,964
(Gablehouser:)...he is also the youngest recipient
of the prestigious Stevenson Award.

11
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:42,510
(Sheldon:)Youngest till the cyborgs rise up.

12
00:00:43,341 --> 00:00:45,301
(Gablehouser:)And now, without any further ado...

13
00:00:45,469 --> 00:00:51,099
(Gablehouser:)...let me introduce the man of the hour,
Mr. Dennis Kim.

14
00:00:52,184 --> 00:00:55,144
Dennis? Dennis.

15
00:00:55,312 --> 00:00:57,482
(Leonard:)What?

16
00:00:58,231 --> 00:01:01,021
(Gablehouser:)Would you like to tell us
about your upcoming research?

